<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Freeze (240)</h1>
<p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>freeze &lt;player&gt;
</pre>
<p>Freezes a player, or thaws one who is frozen: the same command does both. 
A frozen player can only look, say and see who is on; every other command 
gets "You're totally frozen!" They are told "You totally freeze." when 
frozen, and "You unfreeze." when thawed.
</p><p>The player can be anywhere in the game, but must be of a lower level than 
yours. It is logged.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Wizhelp Noshout</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Wizhelp Wizlock</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Wizhelp Ban</a>
</pre>




</div>